{210}{Oh, did you? Are you certain of that? I don't think you did, regardless of what you remember. Memory is like that, always playing tricks on us. For instance, I don't even believe the fellow you spoke with worked for the newspaper, but I could be wrong.}{Oh, did you? Are you certain of that? I don't think you did, regardless of what you remember. Memory is like that, always playing tricks on us. For instance, I don't even believe the fellow you spoke with worked for the newspaper, but I could be wrong.}{}{}{}{ }
